Package: zuarrowlink
Title: Static-Archive Consumer Fixture for zuarrow
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Pedro", "Baltazar", , "pedrobtz@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Not for release. Consumes zuarrow as zucsv, qio, zujson and
    zugodb will, through LinkingTo alone: zuarrow.h and the bundled
    nanoarrow header come off the LinkingTo include path, and ./configure
    links the installed libzuarrow.a statically, so there is no Imports
    entry and no run-time dependency on zuarrow. It builds Arrow arrays and
    a stream with the archive's nanoarrow builders, and reads IPC files
    through zuarrow_open_stream().
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
LinkingTo: 
    zuarrow
Suggests: 
    testthat (>= 3.2.0),
    zuarrow
Config/testthat/edition: 3
